Since April, people have told us their bookings land on the wrong day.
The 4 October export records them merged into one source ticket, but the cause table
distinguishes a shared-parser problem from a booking-v3 form-hint problem.

<Callout>
The old "one issue, one fix" conclusion was wrong. See the signed
[review and replacement decision](/kb/decisions/0003-signed-4471-review).
Separate GitHub tickets are linked below; neither production fix is verified here.
