## Lessons

- Deduplicate by report ID, then classify by tenant and channel evidence, not intake tags.
- Merge only established matching causes; use the [current triage rule](/kb/triage/dedupe).
- Read received and merged dates separately. A desk backlog merge is not a new onset.
